  "content": "Apetayaṃ cakkhumā ekarājā,Harissavaṇṇo paṭhavippabhāso.Taṃ taṃ namassāmi harissavaṇṇaṃ paṭhavippabhāsaṃ,Tayajja guttā viharemu rattiṃ.Ye brāhmaṇā vedagū sabbadhamme,Te me namo te ca maṃ pālayantu.Namatthu buddhānaṃ, namatthu bodhiyā.Namo vimuttānaṃ, namo vimuttiyā.Imaṃ so parittaṃ katvā,Moro vāsamakappayi.",
